(text "DOWN-CONVERSION\nSi5351A: CLK0 = LO (f + IF, IF ~ 5 kHz), CLK1 = 12.288 MHz codec MCLK, CLK2 = 30 MHz AD9851 REFCLK.\nBoth channels use identical SA612A mixers driven by the same LO -> V/I ratio keeps phase.\nIF amp: ADA4807 diff-to-single, gain 2, fc ~17 kHz.  Below ~20 kHz the TS5A3159 switches select the\ndirect (un-mixed) path (BYPASS=1). Switch nodes are AC-coupled and biased at 1.65 V (VMID)." (at 15 15 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid 47527739-dc69-4ebd-9d77-93c62ec49b70))
(text "VMID 1.65 V bias for switch nodes" (at 120 235 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid e58427c9-5666-4607-b131-0ead318f996c))
)
